      "claim": "All recognized fair‑trade certification schemes (Fairtrade International, WFTO, Fair Trade USA, etc.) define eligible product categories that do not include finished electronic devices.",
      "evidence": "Official product‑category lists from these bodies show only agricultural commodities, textiles, and raw minerals (e.g., coffee, cotton, gold) and explicitly exclude consumer electronics such as laptops.",
